-- t278f — correct 3 schema-level comments from t275 that the object-doc pass found inaccurate.
COMMENT ON SCHEMA bi IS 'BI — views for Superset dashboards. Tenant isolation is EXTERNAL: Superset dashboard-level RLS + connecting under a NOBYPASSRLS role. The view bodies do NOT set security_invoker and do NOT reference app.tenant_id (they run definer-side) — verified in staging view SQL.';
COMMENT ON SCHEMA serving IS 'Serving API — the programmatic query surface for read-api. The functions are SECURITY INVOKER (run as the caller); the views run definer-side. Tenant scope = the explicit id_enterprise argument / read-api''s WHERE id_enterprise=$1, now RLS co-enforced (#264: read-api runs as NOBYPASSRLS readapi_ro and stamps app.tenant_id per query).';
COMMENT ON SCHEMA ops IS 'Application OPS (operational plumbing): idempotency_keys (ADR-0007 24h HTTP idempotency cache), capture_observations (ADR-0045 live-capture — sparkplug-agent records PLC count indices), mirror_replay_cursor + mirror_replay_dlq (mirror-worker replay watermark + dead-letter). (function_execution_log was dropped in t266.)';
